### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"Admin@123"}

### Current user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard

### Leave types
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reference/leave-types

### Departments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reference/departments

### Employees
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?page=0&size=10

### All leaves
GET http://localhost:8080/api/leaves?page=0&size=10&status=PENDING

### My leaves
GET http://localhost:8080/api/leaves/mine

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
